                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0dfd9940-7970-49d1-bcda-9ff2d71adbc9",
                                "sense_id": "1000996b-cb0f-3d1b-9817-4ce4f44f8d99",
                                "text": "My lord, know you, there are two sorts of dreams, One sort whereof are only physical, And such are they whereof your Lordship speaks, The other hyper-physical: that is, Dreams sent from heaven, or from the wicked fiends, Which nature doth not form of her own power, But are extrinsicate, by marvel wrought, And such was mine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "21cc70cd-1de3-481b-a176-63ebcae24657",
                                "sense_id": "1000996b-cb0f-3d1b-9817-4ce4f44f8d99",
                                "text": "But those we most properly call sins of omission, which are extrinsicate from sins of commission, as not praying, not reading the word, not believing, not feeding the hungry, &c."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
